---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { contactInfo } from '../../data/contact';
---

<Layout
	lang="en"
	route="privacy"
	title="Privacy Policy"
	description="How Desarrolla Aysén collects, uses and protects information submitted through this site."
>
	<section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-16 sm:py-20">
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-slate-900 sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="mt-4 text-sm text-slate-500">Last updated: July 16, 2026</p>

		<div class="prose mt-10">
			<p>
				This policy explains what information Desarrolla Aysén collects
				through this website, what it's used for, and what choices you have.
			</p>

			<h2>Data controller identity</h2>
			<p>
				This site is operated under the Desarrolla Aysén brand. For the
				purposes of this privacy policy, the contact responsible for
				processing information submitted through this site is{' '}
				{contactInfo.email}.
			</p>

			<h2>What information we collect</h2>
			<p>Through this site's contact form we collect:</p>
			<ul>
				<li>Name</li>
				<li>Email address</li>
				<li>Company (optional)</li>
				<li>Phone (optional)</li>
				<li>The content of the message you send us</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Additionally, to protect the form against spam and automated
				submissions, we use Cloudflare Turnstile, which may process
				technical information about your device and connection (such as
				your IP address) for that sole purpose.
			</p>

			<h2>How we use this information</h2>
			<p>
				We use the data you provide solely to respond to your inquiry and,
				if applicable, to prepare a quote or project proposal for you. We
				don't sell or share this information with third parties for
				marketing purposes.
			</p>

			<h2>How it's sent and stored</h2>
			<p>
				Messages submitted through the form are processed by a Cloudflare
				Worker and delivered directly to Desarrolla Aysén's mailbox. We
				don't store the content of your message in a permanent database;
				only minimal technical information (such as an identifier derived
				from your IP) is kept briefly to prevent abuse of the form, and is
				automatically deleted after a short period (hours).
			</p>

			<h2>Your rights</h2>
			<p>
				You can request to access, correct or delete the information you've
				provided us at any time by writing to {contactInfo.email}.
			</p>

			<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
			<p>
				This policy may be updated periodically. The date of the last update
				is shown at the top of this document.
			</p>

			<h2>Contact</h2>
			<p>
				If you have questions about this privacy policy, you can reach us
				through the <a href="/en/contact/">Contact</a> page.
			</p>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
